    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Dash</strong> is a <strong>first-person plaformer</strong> with a twist : The world map is a <strong>pixel</strong> grid. In this grid, EVERY pixel is a new <strong>procedural</strong> <strong>level</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture</strong> a pixel by completing it <strong>quicker</strong> than other players, and color it as you like for the world to see !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capturing pixels gives you in-game <strong>currency</strong>. Customize your character with the <strong>skins</strong> you can acquire in <strong>free</strong>\u00a0lootboxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide <strong>moveset</strong> to progress through levels. <strong>Jump, dash, wallride, ledge climb...</strong> The timing is key !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game <strong>chat</strong> to gather players and make <strong>art</strong> together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View past <strong>seasons</strong> leaderboards via the control panel. The <strong>best</strong> players will be remembered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat other runners in a high stake <strong>daily level</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Dash</strong> is a <strong>first-person plaformer</strong> with a twist : The world map is a <strong>pixel</strong> grid. In this grid, EVERY pixel is a new <strong>procedural</strong> <strong>level</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture</strong> a pixel by completing it <strong>quicker</strong> than other players, and color it as you like for the world to see !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capturing pixels gives you in-game <strong>currency</strong>. Customize your character with the <strong>skins</strong> you can acquire in <strong>free</strong>\u00a0lootboxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide <strong>moveset</strong> to progress through levels. <strong>Jump, dash, wallride, ledge climb...</strong> The timing is key !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game <strong>chat</strong> to gather players and make <strong>art</strong> together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View past <strong>seasons</strong> leaderboards via the control panel. The <strong>best</strong> players will be remembered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat other runners in a high stake <strong>daily level</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
